return ['domain'=>'simple-ldap-login','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'Simple LDAP Login 2.0.0','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-30T15:26:17+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-30 00:00+0000','x-generator'=>'WP-CLI 2.12.0','messages'=>['Simple LDAP Login'=>'Simple LDAP Login','https://github.com/clifgriffin/simple-ldap-login'=>'https://github.com/clifgriffin/simple-ldap-login','Connect WordPress accounts to Active Directory or OpenLDAP.'=>'将WordPress账户连接到Active Directory或OpenLDAP。','Clif Griffin Development Inc.'=>'Clif Griffin Development Inc.','https://clifgriffin.com'=>'https://clifgriffin.com','Your directory account is suspended. Contact your site administrator.'=>'您的目录账户已被停用。请联系站点管理员。','The directory identity has changed. Contact your site administrator.'=>'目录身份已更改。请联系站点管理员。','User data'=>'用户数据','Single sign-on'=>'单点登录','Accounts'=>'账户','Audit'=>'审计','Profile updates'=>'个人资料更新','Copy standard LDAP profile fields to existing WordPress accounts at login. Recovery accounts and super administrators are excluded.'=>'登录时将标准 LDAP 个人资料字段复制到现有 WordPress 账户。恢复账户和超级管理员不在处理范围内。','Update profiles at login'=>'登录时更新个人资料','Replace names, email, and website with directory values. Empty directory values clear the field. A missing or invalid email stops the update.'=>'使用目录值替换姓名、电子邮件和网站。目录值为空时会清空对应字段。电子邮件缺失或无效时会停止更新。','Custom user fields'=>'自定义用户字段','Copy LDAP fields, such as phone number or department, to WordPress at login. Your theme or other plugins can use these values.'=>'在登录时将 LDAP 字段（如电话号码或部门）复制到 WordPress。您的主题或其他插件可以使用这些值。','Field mappings'=>'字段映射','One mapping per line: LDAP attribute:WordPress meta key:type. Example: %1$s. Types: %2$s or %3$s.'=>'每行一个映射：LDAP 属性：WordPress 元数据键：类型。示例：%1$s。类型：%2$s 或 %3$s。','Group roles'=>'群组角色','Set the WordPress role from LDAP groups at each login. The first matching rule applies. If no rule matches, use the default role. Recovery accounts and super administrators are excluded.'=>'每次登录时根据 LDAP 群组设置 WordPress 角色。应用第一条匹配的规则。如果没有规则匹配，则使用默认角色。恢复账户和超级管理员不在处理范围内。','Group-to-role rules'=>'群组到角色规则','One group:role rule per line. Example: Editors:editor. Leave blank to keep current roles.'=>'每行输入一条 group:role 格式的规则。例如：Editors:editor。留空可保留当前角色。','Enterprise includes scheduled account import, scheduled access removal, and multisite membership rules. Your saved settings are kept.'=>'Enterprise 包含定时账户导入、定时访问权限移除和多站点成员规则。已保存的设置会保留。','View Enterprise upgrade'=>'查看 Enterprise 升级','Enterprise account settings'=>'Enterprise 账户设置','Multisite membership'=>'多站点成员资格','Assign site membership and roles from directory groups. The first matching rule for each site applies. These rules replace the group role rules for network activation.'=>'根据目录群组分配站点成员资格和角色。每个站点应用第一条匹配的规则。在整个网络启用插件时，这些规则会替代群组角色规则。','Group-to-site rules'=>'群组到站点规则','One group:site ID:role rule per line. Example: Editors:2:editor. On group removal, restore prior membership or remove a membership created by these rules. Manual role changes are kept on removal. Leave blank to stop membership updates.'=>'每行输入一条 group:site ID:role 格式的规则。例如：Editors:2:editor。退出群组时，恢复原有成员资格，或移除由这些规则创建的成员资格。移除时会保留手动角色更改。留空可停止更新成员资格。','Scheduled account import'=>'定时账户导入','Import directory accounts once per hour through WordPress scheduled tasks. Set a search account on Connection. Site traffic or a system task must run WordPress cron.'=>'通过 WordPress 定时任务每小时导入一次目录账户。请在“连接”中设置搜索账户。需要通过站点访问或系统任务运行 WordPress cron。','Enable scheduled import'=>'启用定时导入','Create accounts without a first login. Existing local accounts are excluded. No user session is created.'=>'无需首次登录即可创建账户。现有本地账户不在处理范围内。不会创建用户会话。','Import Base DN'=>'导入基本 DN','Leave blank to use the connection Base DN.'=>'留空可使用连接的基本 DN。','Import groups'=>'导入群组','One group per line. Import users in at least one group. Leave blank to import all users below the Import Base DN. Login group restrictions also apply.'=>'每行输入一个群组。导入至少属于其中一个群组的用户。留空可导入“导入基本 DN”下的所有用户。登录群组限制同样适用。','Scheduled access removal'=>'定时移除访问权限','Check managed directory accounts once per hour. A confirmed missing account, disabled AD account, changed directory identity, or failed login group rule suspends access and ends all WordPress sessions. Connection errors keep the current access state.'=>'每小时检查一次受管理的目录账户。确认账户不存在、AD 账户已禁用、目录身份已更改或不满足登录群组规则时，会停用访问权限并结束所有 WordPress 会话。连接错误不会更改当前访问状态。','Enable scheduled access removal'=>'启用定时移除访问权限','Keep user data and content. Restore access after a later successful directory check. Recovery accounts and super administrators are excluded. Existing suspensions remain if the task or license stops.'=>'保留用户数据和内容。后续目录检查成功后恢复访问权限。恢复账户和超级管理员不在处理范围内。如果任务停止或许可证失效，现有停用状态仍会保留。','Custom field storage'=>'自定义字段存储','Leave the defaults unless your integration uses different user meta keys.'=>'除非您的集成使用不同的用户元键，否则保留默认值。','LDAP value suffix'=>'LDAP值后缀','Stores the LDAP value, such as phone_ldap.'=>'存储LDAP值，例如phone_ldap。','WordPress value suffix'=>'WordPress值后缀','Stores the editable WordPress value, such as phone_wp.'=>'存储可编辑的WordPress值，例如phone_wp。','Single sign-on (SSO)'=>'单点登录（SSO）','Sign users in to WordPress after your web server authenticates them.'=>'在您的 Web 服务器验证用户后，将用户登录到 WordPress。','Enable single sign-on'=>'启用单点登录','Users do not need a second login for WordPress.'=>'用户无需为 WordPress 进行第二次登录。','Configure your web server to authenticate users and set REMOTE_USER. Enter an LDAP search account on Connection.'=>'配置您的 Web 服务器以验证用户并设置 REMOTE_USER。在连接中输入 LDAP 搜索帐户。','Do not copy browser headers into REMOTE_USER. Block access that bypasses web server authentication.'=>'不要将浏览器头复制到 REMOTE_USER。阻止绕过 Web 服务器身份验证的访问。','Web server authentication'=>'Web服务器身份验证','REMOTE_USER is present.'=>'REMOTE_USER存在。','REMOTE_USER is missing. Check the web server configuration.'=>'REMOTE_USER缺失。检查Web服务器配置。','An Enterprise license is required to collect, read, or export audit history. Existing records are kept.'=>'收集、查看或导出审计历史需要 Enterprise 许可证。现有记录会保留。','Enterprise audit settings'=>'Enterprise 审计设置','Audit history'=>'审计历史','Record login results and account changes. Records contain event names and account IDs. Passwords, directory field values, and credentials are excluded.'=>'记录登录结果和账户更改。记录包含事件名称和账户 ID。不记录密码、目录字段值或凭据。','Enable audit history'=>'启用审计历史','Store private WordPress records. Collection is off by default. Existing records remain when collection stops.'=>'存储非公开的 WordPress 记录。默认关闭收集。停止收集时会保留现有记录。','Retention (days)'=>'保留期限（天）','Default: 30. Range: 1 to 3650. A daily task removes older records while collection is enabled.'=>'默认值：30。范围：1 到 3650。启用收集期间，每日任务会移除过期记录。','Export CSV'=>'导出 CSV','Latest 50 records. The export includes all retained records in this scope. Times use UTC.'=>'最近 50 条记录。导出包含当前范围内保留的所有记录。时间使用 UTC。','Time (UTC)'=>'时间（UTC）','Event'=>'事件','Actor ID'=>'操作人 ID','User ID'=>'用户 ID','Site ID'=>'站点 ID','You do not have permission to export these records.'=>'您无权导出这些记录。','Activate an Enterprise license to change these settings. Your saved settings are kept.'=>'激活 Enterprise 许可证后才能更改这些设置。已保存的设置会保留。','A Pro setting is not valid. Check the format and role names.'=>'某项 Pro 设置无效。请检查格式和角色名称。','The update was stopped. Activate Simple LDAP Login Pro to restore LDAP login.'=>'更新已停止。激活 Simple LDAP Login Pro 以恢复 LDAP 登录。','Update blocked: This package does not include all Pro files. To install Free, deactivate the plugin first. Your installed files and settings are unchanged.'=>'更新被阻止：此包不包含所有 Pro 文件。要安装免费版，请先停用插件。您已安装的文件和设置保持不变。','WordPress could not reactivate the plugin.'=>'WordPress无法重新激活插件。','Simple LDAP Login needs PHP 8.1 or later.'=>'Simple LDAP Login需要PHP 8.1或更高版本。','Plugin files are missing. Reinstall Simple LDAP Login from the release ZIP.'=>'插件文件丢失。从发布ZIP重新安装Simple LDAP Login。','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'您没有权限更改这些设置。','The settings scope has changed. Open the settings page and try again.'=>'设置范围已更改。打开设置页面并重试。','You do not have permission to view these settings.'=>'您没有权限查看这些设置。','Network settings'=>'网络设置','Site settings'=>'站点设置','LDAP login settings'=>'LDAP登录设置','Connect to LDAP, then test a login before enabling authentication.'=>'连接到LDAP，然后在启用身份验证之前测试登录。','LDAP login and SSO are disabled by SLL_DISABLE_LDAP in wp-config.php.'=>'LDAP登录和SSO因wp-config.php中的SLL_DISABLE_LDAP而被禁用。','Your saved settings use backup LDAP servers, SSO, or custom user fields. Install Simple LDAP Login Pro to use these features. Your settings are kept.'=>'保存的设置使用了备用 LDAP 服务器、SSO 或自定义用户字段。请安装 Simple LDAP Login Pro 以使用这些功能。您的设置会保留。','The saved LDAP search password cannot be read. Enter it again on the Connection tab.'=>'无法读取保存的LDAP搜索密码。在连接选项卡上重新输入。','PHP LDAP is missing. Ask your host to install it before enabling LDAP login.'=>'缺少 PHP LDAP。请向您的主机请求安装它，然后再启用 LDAP 登录。','LDAP passwords are sent without encryption. Use StartTLS or LDAPS if your server supports it.'=>'LDAP 密码以未加密的方式发送。如果您的服务器支持，请使用 StartTLS 或 LDAPS。','Save settings'=>'保存设置','Settings on other tabs are kept.'=>'其他选项卡上的设置将被保留。','Save settings before you check the connection. The check uses saved settings.'=>'检查连接前请先保存设置。检查使用已保存的设置。','Check Connection'=>'检查连接','Open the Testing tab for login tests and more information.'=>'打开“测试”选项卡以测试登录并查看详细信息。','LDAP connection'=>'LDAP 连接','LDAP login'=>'LDAP 登录','Enable LDAP authentication.'=>'启用 LDAP 身份验证。','Directory type'=>'目录类型','Active Directory'=>'Active Directory','OpenLDAP / other LDAP directory'=>'OpenLDAP / 其他 LDAP 目录','LDAP servers'=>'LDAP 服务器','One hostname or IP address per line. An active Pro or Enterprise license enables backup servers. Without an active license, only the first server is used.'=>'每行输入一个主机名或 IP 地址。有效的 Pro 或 Enterprise 许可证可启用备用服务器。没有有效许可证时，仅使用第一个服务器。','Base DN'=>'基础 DN','Where to search for users. Example: DC=example,DC=org.'=>'搜索用户的位置。示例：DC=example,DC=org。','Username suffix'=>'用户名后缀','Added to usernames without a domain. Example: @example.org.'=>'添加到没有域的用户名。示例：@example.org。','Windows domain'=>'Windows 域','Short domain name, such as EXAMPLE. Takes priority over the username suffix.'=>'短域名，例如 EXAMPLE。优先于用户名后缀。','Connection security'=>'连接安全性','TLS requires a trusted server certificate.'=>'TLS 需要受信任的服务器证书。','StartTLS (recommended)'=>'StartTLS（推荐）','LDAPS'=>'LDAPS','Unencrypted LDAP'=>'未加密的 LDAP','Unencrypted LDAP requires permission on the Advanced tab.'=>'未加密的 LDAP 需要在高级选项卡上获得权限。','Port'=>'端口','389 for StartTLS; 636 for LDAPS.'=>'StartTLS 使用 389；LDAPS 使用 636。','Search subfolders'=>'搜索子文件夹','Search all organizational units below the Base DN.'=>'搜索基础 DN 下面的所有组织单位。','LDAP search account'=>'LDAP 搜索账户','An LDAP account with read access to users and groups.'=>'具有读取用户和组权限的 LDAP 账户。','Search account'=>'搜索账户','LDAP bind DN or account name.'=>'LDAP 绑定 DN 或账户名称。','Search account password'=>'搜索账户密码','Leave blank to keep the saved password.'=>'留空以保留已保存的密码。','Login rules'=>'登录规则','Require LDAP passwords'=>'要求 LDAP 密码','Block WordPress passwords except for recovery access.'=>'阻止 WordPress 密码，除非用于恢复访问。','Local recovery access'=>'本地恢复访问','Selected administrators'=>'选定的管理员','All super administrators (legacy)'=>'所有超级管理员（遗留）','All administrators (legacy)'=>'所有管理员（遗留）','Off'=>'关闭','Choose who can use a WordPress password when LDAP passwords are required.'=>'选择可以在要求 LDAP 密码时使用 WordPress 密码的用户。','Automatic account creation'=>'自动账户创建','Create a WordPress account on the first successful LDAP login.'=>'在第一次成功的 LDAP 登录时创建 WordPress 账户。','Default role'=>'默认角色','For new accounts only.'=>'仅适用于新账户。','Required groups'=>'所需组','One group name per line. Users must belong to at least one. Leave blank to allow all LDAP users.'=>'每行一个组名。用户必须至少属于一个。留空以允许所有 LDAP 用户。','Recovery accounts'=>'恢复账户','For Selected administrators only. Use separate local accounts with WordPress passwords. Hold Ctrl or Command to select multiple accounts.'=>'仅适用于选定的管理员。使用单独的本地账户和 WordPress 密码。按住 Ctrl 或 Command 选择多个账户。','Connection options'=>'连接选项','Change these only if the default values do not work with your directory.'=>'仅在默认值与您的目录不兼容时更改这些设置。','LDAP timeout (seconds)'=>'LDAP 超时（秒）','Maximum wait for an LDAP operation. Default: 5 seconds.'=>'LDAP 操作的最大等待时间。默认：5 秒。','Login attribute'=>'登录属性','Attribute used to find users. Default: uid.'=>'用于查找用户的属性。默认：uid。','Allow unencrypted LDAP'=>'允许未加密的 LDAP','Allow passwords to be sent without encryption.'=>'允许密码以未加密的方式发送。','Group search'=>'组搜索','Group base DN'=>'组基础 DN','Leave blank to use the user Base DN.'=>'留空以使用用户基础 DN。','Group name attribute'=>'组名称属性','Default: cn.'=>'默认：cn。','Group member attribute'=>'组成员属性','Default: memberUid. Use member or uniqueMember if groups store user DNs.'=>'默认：memberUid。如果组存储用户 DN，请使用 member 或 uniqueMember。','Profile attributes'=>'个人资料属性','LDAP attributes copied to new WordPress accounts.'=>'复制到新 WordPress 账户的 LDAP 属性。','First name attribute'=>'名字属性','Last name attribute'=>'姓氏属性','Email attribute'=>'电子邮件属性','Website attribute'=>'网站属性','Data retention'=>'数据保留','Delete settings when removing the plugin'=>'删除插件时删除设置','Delete saved settings and LDAP credentials when WordPress deletes the plugin. Keep user accounts.'=>'当 WordPress 删除插件时，删除保存的设置和 LDAP 凭据。保留用户账户。','Recovery'=>'恢复','If you are locked out, rename the simple-ldap-login folder using your hosting file manager. Log in with a WordPress administrator password, then restore the folder and correct the settings.'=>'如果您被锁定，请使用您的主机文件管理器重命名 simple-ldap-login 文件夹。使用 WordPress 管理员密码登录，然后恢复文件夹并更正设置。','For certificate errors, ask your host to configure the trusted LDAP certificate authority.'=>'对于证书错误，请要求您的主机配置受信任的 LDAP 证书颁发机构。','LDAP tests'=>'LDAP 测试','Tests use saved settings.'=>'测试使用保存的设置。','Save your settings, then run both tests. Keep this administrator session open.'=>'保存您的设置，然后运行两个测试。保持此管理员会话打开。','Tests check the connection, password, and required groups. They do not create accounts or sign users in.'=>'测试检查连接、密码和所需组。它们不会创建账户或登录用户。','Connect to LDAP and test the search account, if set.'=>'连接到 LDAP 并测试搜索账户（如果设置）。','Test LDAP login'=>'测试 LDAP 登录','Check an LDAP username, password, and group membership.'=>'检查 LDAP 用户名、密码和组成员资格。','LDAP username'=>'LDAP 用户名','LDAP password'=>'LDAP 密码','After both tests pass, enable LDAP and try logging in from another browser.'=>'在两个测试通过后，启用 LDAP 并尝试从另一个浏览器登录。','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','Connection test passed.'=>'连接测试通过。','Cannot connect to LDAP. Check the server, port, TLS certificate, and search account.'=>'无法连接到 LDAP。检查服务器、端口、TLS 证书和搜索账户。','LDAP login test passed. No account was created.'=>'LDAP 登录测试通过。未创建账户。','LDAP login test failed. Check the username, password, and required groups.'=>'LDAP 登录测试失败。检查用户名、密码和所需组。','Could not save settings. Check the values and try again.'=>'无法保存设置。检查值并重试。','Connection'=>'连接','Access'=>'访问','Advanced'=>'高级','Testing'=>'测试','Support'=>'支持','Your LDAP login is valid, but you need a WordPress account. Contact your site administrator.'=>'您的 LDAP 登录有效，但您需要一个 WordPress 账户。请联系您的网站管理员。','Your LDAP username is not a valid WordPress username. Contact your site administrator.'=>'您的 LDAP 用户名不是有效的 WordPress 用户名。请联系您的网站管理员。','The default WordPress role is not available. Contact your site administrator.'=>'默认的 WordPress 角色不可用。请联系您的网站管理员。','Could not create your WordPress account. Contact your site administrator.'=>'无法创建您的 WordPress 账户。请联系您的网站管理员。','Use your WordPress password for this recovery account.'=>'使用您的 WordPress 密码作为此恢复账户。','License'=>'许可证','Go Pro'=>'升级到 Pro','Could not check your license. Features in your last verified plan remain active. Try again on the License tab.'=>'无法检查许可证。上次验证的方案中的功能仍然有效。请在“许可证”选项卡中重试。','Your license has expired. Paid features are off. Renew your license, then select Check license on the License tab.'=>'许可证已过期。付费功能已关闭。请续订许可证，然后在“许可证”选项卡中选择“检查许可证”。','Your license plan has not been verified. Select Check license on the License tab. Paid features stay off until the plan is verified.'=>'许可证方案尚未验证。请在“许可证”选项卡中选择“检查许可证”。在方案通过验证前，付费功能保持关闭。','Activate your Pro or Enterprise license on the License tab to use paid features.'=>'在“许可证”选项卡中激活 Pro 或 Enterprise 许可证，即可使用付费功能。','Backup LDAP servers'=>'备用 LDAP 服务器','Try the next server if a directory server cannot be reached. All servers must use the same directory.'=>'如果无法连接到目录服务器，则尝试下一个服务器。所有服务器必须使用同一个目录。','Give staff one less password prompt. Sign in through your web server with Kerberos, NTLM, or other server authentication.'=>'减少员工输入密码的次数。通过 Web 服务器使用 Kerberos、NTLM 或其他服务器身份验证方式登录。','Turn directory groups into WordPress roles at each login. Give editors, authors, and other teams the access they need.'=>'每次登录时根据目录组分配 WordPress 角色。为编辑、作者和其他团队提供所需的访问权限。','Keep names, email addresses, and websites current. Copy directory values to existing WordPress profiles at login.'=>'保持姓名、电子邮件地址和网站信息最新。登录时将目录中的值复制到现有 WordPress 个人资料。','Put phone numbers, departments, and other LDAP fields to work in WordPress. Map text and number fields for your theme or plugins.'=>'在 WordPress 中使用电话号码、部门和其他 LDAP 字段。为主题或插件映射文本和数字字段。','Have accounts ready before the first login. Import directory users each hour, with filters for groups and directory location.'=>'在首次登录前准备好账户。每小时导入目录用户，并按组和目录位置筛选。','Check managed accounts each hour. Suspend access and end sessions when directory checks confirm removal or lost access. Keep user content.'=>'每小时检查受管理账户。当目录检查确认账户已移除或访问权限已丢失时，暂停访问并结束会话。保留用户内容。','Manage access across your WordPress network. Use directory groups to assign site membership and roles, then remove access when groups change.'=>'管理整个 WordPress 网络的访问权限。使用目录组分配站点成员资格和角色，并在组更改时移除访问权限。','Audit history and CSV export'=>'审计历史和 CSV 导出','See login results, role changes, imports, and access changes in one place. Set record retention and export the history to CSV.'=>'集中查看登录结果、角色更改、导入和访问权限更改。设置记录保留期限，并将历史导出为 CSV。','Simple LDAP Login Pro and Enterprise'=>'Simple LDAP Login Pro 和 Enterprise','Choose your LDAP plan.'=>'选择 LDAP 方案。','Pro adds single sign-on and user data updates. Enterprise adds scheduled account management, multisite membership rules, and audit history.'=>'Pro 增加单点登录和用户数据更新。Enterprise 增加定时账户管理、多站点成员规则和审计历史。','Both plans cover one site. Your existing LDAP settings stay in place.'=>'两种方案均适用于一个站点。现有 LDAP 设置会保留。','Pro — $99/year'=>'Pro — 每年 $99','Enterprise — $499/year'=>'Enterprise — 每年 $499','All Free features, plus:'=>'所有 Free 功能，另加：','Everything in Pro, plus:'=>'所有 Pro 功能，另加：','Buy Pro'=>'购买 Pro','Get Enterprise'=>'获取 Enterprise','Buy Enterprise'=>'购买 Enterprise','Scheduled tasks use WordPress cron and need site traffic or a system task. Single sign-on requires web server authentication. Multisite rules require network activation.'=>'定时任务使用 WordPress cron，需要站点流量或系统任务触发。单点登录需要 Web 服务器身份验证。多站点规则需要在网络中激活插件。','Your saved license needs a plan check. Install Pro, then select Check license on the License tab.'=>'已保存的许可证需要检查方案。请安装 Pro，然后在“许可证”选项卡中选择“检查许可证”。','After purchase, replace Free with the Pro ZIP from your receipt. Then activate your license on the License tab in Pro. Your LDAP settings stay in place.'=>'购买后，请使用收据中的 Pro ZIP 替换 Free。然后在 Pro 的“许可证”选项卡中激活许可证。LDAP 设置会保留。','PaidCommunities handles checkout. It receives your IP address, browser details, and the information you enter at checkout. LDAP credentials and user records are not sent.'=>'PaidCommunities 处理结账。它会接收您的 IP 地址、浏览器详细信息以及结账时输入的信息。LDAP 凭据和用户记录不会发送。','License status updated.'=>'许可证状态已更新。','Could not verify the license. Check your key and connection, then try again.'=>'无法验证许可证。请检查您的密钥和连接，然后重试。','Enter the license key from your purchase receipt.'=>'输入您购买收据上的许可证密钥。','Plan not verified'=>'方案未验证','Expired'=>'已过期','Inactive'=>'未激活','License status'=>'许可证状态','Active'=>'有效','Not activated'=>'未激活','Current plan'=>'当前方案','Enterprise'=>'Enterprise','Pro'=>'Pro','Enterprise adds scheduled account import and access removal, multisite membership rules, and audit history with CSV export.'=>'Enterprise 增加定时账户导入和访问权限移除、多站点成员规则，以及支持 CSV 导出的审计历史。','Get Enterprise opens checkout for a new license. It does not change or cancel your Pro subscription. Manage that subscription separately through PaidCommunities. After purchase, deactivate this key, choose Enterprise, and activate the new key.'=>'“获取 Enterprise”会打开新许可证的结账页面。它不会更改或取消您的 Pro 订阅。请通过 PaidCommunities 单独管理该订阅。购买后，停用此密钥，选择 Enterprise，然后激活新密钥。','Purchased plan'=>'已购方案','Choose the plan on your purchase receipt. This choice is used only when activating a key. A license check verifies which features you can use.'=>'选择购买收据上的方案。此选择仅在激活密钥时使用。许可证检查会验证您可以使用的功能。','License key'=>'许可证密钥','Activate license'=>'激活许可证','Deactivate license'=>'停用许可证','Check license'=>'检查许可证','PaidCommunities handles licenses. Activation sends your license key, site domain, plugin version, and server IP address. License checks send site details. LDAP credentials and user records are not sent.'=>'PaidCommunities 管理许可证。激活时会发送许可证密钥、站点域名、插件版本和服务器 IP 地址。许可证检查会发送站点详细信息。LDAP 凭据和用户记录不会发送。','Select a license action.'=>'选择一个许可证操作。','Activating license…'=>'正在激活许可证…','Deactivating license…'=>'正在停用许可证…','License error'=>'许可证错误','License updated'=>'许可证已更新','LDAP login failed. Check your username and password or contact your site administrator.'=>'LDAP 登录失败。检查您的用户名和密码或联系您的网站管理员。','Your account is not allowed to log in to this site.'=>'您的账户不允许登录此站点。','LDAP login is unavailable. Contact your site administrator.'=>'LDAP 登录不可用。请联系您的站点管理员。','PHP OpenSSL is required to save the LDAP search password.'=>'需要 PHP OpenSSL 来保存 LDAP 搜索密码。','Could not read or save the LDAP search password. Enter it again. If this continues, ask your host to check OpenSSL and the encryption key.'=>'无法读取或保存 LDAP 搜索密码。请重新输入。如果问题持续，请让您的主机检查 OpenSSL 和加密密钥。','Select a recovery account on the Access tab, or turn local recovery access Off.'=>'在访问选项卡上选择一个恢复账户，或关闭本地恢复访问。','Enable Allow unencrypted LDAP on the Advanced tab, or choose StartTLS or LDAPS.'=>'在高级选项卡上启用允许未加密的 LDAP，或选择 StartTLS 或 LDAPS。','A custom field mapping uses a protected or invalid WordPress user meta key.'=>'自定义字段映射使用了受保护或无效的 WordPress 用户元数据键。','Enter a Base DN and at least one LDAP server before enabling LDAP login.'=>'在启用 LDAP 登录之前，请输入一个基础 DN 和至少一个 LDAP 服务器。','WordPress could not save the settings. Try again.'=>'WordPress 无法保存设置。请重试。','LDAP protocol version'=>'LDAP 协议版本','LDAP timeout'=>'LDAP 超时','Check the submitted settings. No changes were saved.'=>'检查提交的设置。没有保存任何更改。','Check %s. No changes were saved.'=>'检查 %s。没有保存任何更改。']];